# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SCEDULAR FRONTEND — API URL CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# AUTO-DETECTION (smart default — you usually don't need to change this):
#   • Localhost (`npm run dev` / Vite dev server on port 5173 etc.)
#       → automatically uses  http://localhost:8090/api
#   • Deployed on Vercel (.vercel.app domain)
#       → automatically uses  same-origin  /api
#         (Vercel rewrites route /api/* → serverless function api/index.ts)
#
# ONLY set VITE_API_URL explicitly if:
#   - you host the backend separately at a custom domain (not Vercel), OR
#   - you run the backend on a non-standard port locally.
#
# No trailing slash!
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8090/api
